    "G\u00fcndo\u011fumu tetikleyicisi: ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi.": "Sonopkoms-trigger: geen tuisligging gestel nie.", // EN: Sunrise trigger: no home location set.
    "A\u011f \u00fczerinden PC veya TV uyand\u0131rma (Home Assistant standard\u0131)": "Wek rekenaar of TV oor netwerk (Home Assistant standaard)", // EN: Wake PC or TV over network (Home Assistant standard)
