    "CSV olarak d\u0131\u015fa aktar": "Voer uit as CSV", // EN: Export as CSV
    "JSON olarak d\u0131\u015fa aktar": "Voer uit as JSON", // EN: Export as JSON
    "Kay\u0131tl\u0131 ge\u00e7mi\u015f yok; yaln\u0131zca son okumalar d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u0131l\u0131r.": "Geen gestoorde geskiedenis nog; slegs die jongste lesings word uitgevoer.", // EN: No stored history yet; only the latest readings are exported.
    "G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en cihaz ekleyince ger\u00e7ek de\u011fer burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Voeg 'n kragmetingsapparaat by om werklike waardes hier te sien.", // EN: Add a power-metering device to see real values here.
    "{0} g\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcml\u00fc cihazdan ger\u00e7ek okuma.": "Lewende lesing van {0} gemete apparaat(e).", // EN: Live reading from {0} metered device(s).
    "Cihazlardan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131namad\u0131 (\u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 olabilir).": "Kon nie metings lees nie (apparaat kan vanlyn wees).", // EN: Could not read measurements (devices may be offline).
    "\u00b7 Etkin (her gece 23:00)": "\u00b7 Aktief (nagliks om 23:00)", // EN: · Active (nightly at 23:00)
    "\u00b7 Etkin (konum tetiklemesi yak\u0131nda)": "\u00b7 Aktief (liggingtrigger binnekort)", // EN: · Active (location trigger coming soon)
    "Bu strateji zamanlamayla \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken (masa\u00fcst\u00fcnde tepsideyken) her gece 23:00'te se\u00e7ili enerji cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc keser.": "Hierdie strategie loop op 'n skedule: terwyl die app oop is (in die stelselbalk op die lessenaar), sny dit krag na die geselekteerde energie-apparaat elke nag om 23:00.", // EN: This strategy runs on a schedule: while the app is open (in the tray on desktop), it cuts power to the selected energy devices nightly at 23:00.
    "Bu strateji konum tetiklemesine dayan\u0131r; otomatik konum tetiklemesi hen\u00fcz yok. Etkinle\u015ftirdi\u011finde kaydedilir ama kendili\u011finden \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaz.": "Hierdie strategie berus op ligging-triggers; outomatiese ligging-triggering is nog nie beskikbaar nie. Aktiveer dit om dit te stoor, maar dit sal nie van self af loop nie.", // EN: This strategy relies on location triggers; automatic location triggering isn't available yet. Enabling saves it, but it won't run on its own.
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz otomatik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131yor; kaydetti\u011finde a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da se\u00e7ti\u011fin saatte (zamanlamayla) \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Hierdie trig tipe loop nog nie outomaties nie; sodra gestoor, loop dit op die tyd wat jy hieronder kies (geskeduleer).", // EN: This trigger type doesn't run automatically yet; once saved, it runs at the time you pick below (scheduled).
    "G\u00fcvenlik modu tetikleyicisi kurulamaz: uygulamada okunabilen ger\u00e7ek bir alarm paneli durumu veya NEXUS d\u00fczeyinde bir mod anahtar\u0131 hen\u00fcz yok. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "'n Sekuriteitsmodus-trigger kan nie opgestel word nie: die app het nog geen leesbare alarm-paneel toestand of NEXUS-vlak modus skakelaar nie. Werkende tipes: Timer, Weer, Toesteltoestand en Alarm Geaktiveer (sensor).", // EN: A security-mode trigger can't be set up: the app has no readable alarm-panel state or NEXUS-level mode switch yet. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz desteklenmiyor, bu y\u00fczden kaydedilemez. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "Hierdie trig tipe word nog nie ondersteun nie, dus kan dit nie gestoor word nie. Werkende tipes: Timer, Weer, Toesteltoestand en Alarm Geaktiveer (sensor).", // EN: This trigger type isn't supported yet, so it can't be saved. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Hava Ko\u015fulu": "Weerstoestand", // EN: Weather Condition
    "Ev konumunun ger\u00e7ek hava verisi uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken yakla\u015f\u0131k 10 dk'da bir okunur. Ko\u015ful sa\u011flanm\u0131yorken sa\u011flan\u0131r hale geldi\u011finde senaryo bir kez \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Regte weerdata vir jou tuisligging word ongeveer elke 10 minute gelees terwyl die app oop is. Die scenario loop een keer wanneer die toestand van nie-voldaan na voldaan verander.", // EN: Real weather data for your home location is read about every 10 minutes while the app is open. The scenario runs once when the condition goes from not met to met.
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k (\u00b0C)": "Temperatuur (\u00b0C)", // EN: Temperature (°C)
    "R\u00fczg\u00e2r (km/sa)": "Wind (km/h)", // EN: Wind (km/h)
    "Ya\u011f\u0131\u015f (mm)": "Neerslag (mm)", // EN: Precipitation (mm)
