    "Ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi, hava verisi okunamaz. \u00d6nce": "Geen tuisplek is gestel nie, dus kan weer nie gelees word nie. Kies eers 'n ligging", // EN: No home location is set, so weather can't be read. First
    "konum se\u00e7": "Kies eers jou tuisplek.", // EN: choose a location
    "\u00d6nce ev konumunu se\u00e7.": "Voer 'n drempelwaarde in.", // EN: Choose your home location first.
    "Bir e\u015fik de\u011fer gir.": "Weer-trigge: geen tuisplek gestel nie.", // EN: Enter a threshold value.
    "Hava durumu tetikleyicisi: ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi.": "Scenario om te laat loop wanneer dit getrig word", // EN: Weather trigger: no home location set.
    "Tetiklenince \u00c7al\u0131\u015facak Senaryo": "Slegs kennisgewing", // EN: Scenario to Run When Triggered
    "Yaln\u0131zca bildirim": "Geskeduleerde outomatisasies loop terwyl die app oop is; op die lessenaar bly hulle loop terwyl die app in die lade bly.", // EN: Notification only
    "Zamanlamal\u0131 otomasyonlar uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 tepsideyken de zamanlamalar devam eder.": "Outomatisasies loop terwyl die app oop is; op die lessenaar gaan skedules voort terwyl die app in die lade bly.", // EN: Scheduled automations run while the app is open; on desktop they keep running while the app stays in the tray.
    "Otomasyonlar uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 tepsideyken de zamanlamalar devam eder.": "Nog nie uitgevoer nie", // EN: Automations run while the app is open; on desktop, schedules continue while the app stays in the tray.
