    "Sipari\u015fle ilgili sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Probleem met 'n bestelling? Stuur terugvoer", // EN: Problem with an order? Send feedback
    "Haz\u0131r olanlar \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r durumda; haz\u0131r olmayanlar \"Yak\u0131nda\" olarak i\u015faretlidir.": "Gereed items werk nou; items wat nie gereed is nie, word gemerk as \"Binnekort beskikbaar\".", // EN: Ready items work now; items that are not ready are marked "Coming soon".
    "Apple Watch Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "Apple Watch Ondersteuning Binnekort", // EN: Apple Watch Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz Apple Watch uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bile\u011finden senaryolar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6rebileceksin.": "NEXUS sluit nog nie 'n Apple Watch-app in nie. Sodra dit vrygestel word, sal jy scenario's kan uitvoer en kritieke waarskuwings van jou pols af kan sien.", // EN: NEXUS does not include an Apple Watch app yet. Once released, you will be able to run scenarios and see critical alerts from your wrist.
    "Bug\u00fcn Ne Yapabilirsin": "Wat Jy Vandag Kan Doen", // EN: What You Can Do Today
    "Kritik olaylar i\u00e7in bildirimleri a\u00e7\u0131k tut; uyar\u0131lar\u0131 telefonunda hemen g\u00f6r\u00fcrs\u00fcn.": "Hou kennisgewing aan vir kritieke gebeurtenisse; jy sien waarskuwings onmiddellik op jou telefoon.", // EN: Keep notifications on for critical events; you see alerts on your phone right away.
    "Saatinde bu bildirimlerin g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcp g\u00f6r\u00fcnmeyece\u011fi iPhone'unun Watch ayarlar\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS saate \u00f6zel bir \u015fey g\u00f6ndermez.": "Of hierdie kennisgewings op jou horlosie vertoon word, hang af van jou iPhone se Watch-instellings; NEXUS stuur niks spesifieks na die horlosie nie.", // EN: Whether these notifications show on your watch depends on your iPhone's Watch settings; NEXUS sends nothing specific to the watch.
    "Bildirim Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Maak Kennisgewinginstellings oop", // EN: Open Notification Settings
    "Anahtar\u0131 kopyala": "Kopieer sleutel", // EN: Copy key
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7": "Maak oop in verifikasie-app", // EN: Open in authenticator app
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131na eri\u015fimini kaybedersen giri\u015fte kod istenece\u011fi i\u00e7in hesab\u0131na giremezsin. Bu anahtar\u0131 g\u00fcvenli bir yere kaydet.": "As jy toegang tot jou verifikasie-app verloor, sal jy nie kan aanmeld nie, want 'n kode is benodig tydens aanmelding. Stoor hierdie sleutel \u00earens veilig.", // EN: If you lose access to your authenticator app you won't be able to sign in, because a code is required at login. Save this key somewhere safe.
    "Anahtar kopyaland\u0131 \u2713": "Sleutel gekopieer \u2713", // EN: Key copied ✓
    "Kopyalanamad\u0131; anahtar\u0131 elle yaz.": "Kon nie kopieer nie; tik die sleutel met die hand.", // EN: Couldn't copy; type the key by hand.
    "6 haneli kod": "6-syfer kode", // EN: 6-digit code
