    "Hesab\u0131m": "My Rekening", // EN: My Account
    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Verwyder My Rekening", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Jou rekening, profiel en gesinkroniseerde data word permanent verwyder. As jy 'n aktiewe NEXUS+-intekening het, kanselleer dit eers vanaf Fakturering. Dit kan nie ongedaan gemaak word nie.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Is jy seker? Tik weer om te verwyder", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Besig met verwydering\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Rekening verwyder. Onthou om jou intekening van jou Whop-rekening te kanselleer.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Jou rekening en data is verwyder.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "Om NEXUS-data op hierdie toestel te verwyder, is Instellings \u2192 Teken uit genoeg; daar is geen wolk-rekening nie.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Die bediener-kant verwydering van rekeninge is nog nie uitgerol nie. Jy kan vir nou uitteken.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "! Ek het Moet Nie Steur nie aangeskakel; geen kennisgewings sal jou pla nie. [AKSIE: AKTIVEER_MOET_NIE_STEUR_NIE]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\"scenario kan vir nou met een tik vanaf die Tik om te Hardloop-kaart op die tuisskerm uitgevoer word. Sodra NEXUS in die App Store is, sal jy dit direk van hierdie skerm na Siri kan voeg.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
    "\" ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinecek. Emin misin?": "\" en al sy instellings sal permanent verwyder word. Is jy seker?", // EN: " and all its settings will be deleted permanently. Are you sure?
