    "Aboneli\u011fin hemen sona erer ve bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "Jou subskripsie eindig onmiddellik en geen verdere betaling word geneem nie.", // EN: Your subscription ends immediately and no further payment is taken.
    "Aboneli\u011finiz bulunmuyor.": "Jy het nie 'n subskripsie nie.", // EN: You don't have a subscription.
    "Aboneli\u011finiz yok \u2014 t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u015fu an \u00fccretsiz. NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda.": "Jy het nie 'n subskripsie nie \u2014 elke funksie is tans gratis. NEXUS+ kom binnekort.", // EN: You don't have a subscription — every feature is free right now. NEXUS+ is coming soon.
