    "Adres biliyorsan tek tek yaz, bilmiyorsan modem a\u011f\u0131n\u0131n \u00f6n ekini b\u0131rak (192.168.1 gibi) \u2014 NEXUS 254 adresi birlikte yoklar.": "As jy die adres weet, tik dit in; indien nie, laat jou router-netwerkvoorvoegsel (soos 192.168.1) \u2014 NEXUS kontroleer al 254 adresse.", // EN: If you know the address, type it; if not, leave your router network prefix (like 192.168.1) — NEXUS checks all 254 addresses.
