    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu. Okunmayan bir de\u011fer varsa \"Durum okunmad\u0131\" yazar.": "Laast bekende toestand van jou toestelle. 'n Waarde wat nie gelees is nie, wys \"Toestand nie gelees nie\".", // EN: Last known state of your devices. A value that was not read shows "State not read".
    "A\u00c7IK G\u00d6R\u00dcNEN C\u0130HAZLAR": "TOESTELLE WAT AAN VERSKYN", // EN: DEVICES THAT APPEAR ON
    "A\u00e7\u0131k g\u00f6r\u00fcnen cihaz yok.": "Geen toestel blyk aan te wees nie.", // EN: No device appears to be on.
    "G\u00dcVENL\u0130K C\u0130HAZLARI": "SEKERHEIDSTOESTELLE", // EN: SECURITY DEVICES
    "Kilit, kap\u0131 sens\u00f6r\u00fc veya kamera eklenmemi\u015f.": "Geen slot, deur sensor of kamera is bygevoeg nie.", // EN: No lock, door sensor or camera added.
    "Durum okunmad\u0131": "Toestand nie gelees nie", // EN: State not read
    "Bu zaten \u015fu an kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n e-posta adresi. Farkl\u0131 bir adres gir.": "Dit is reeds die e-posadres wat jy gebruik. Voer 'n ander een in.", // EN: This is already the email address you are using. Enter a different one.
    "Bu e-posta adresi ba\u015fka bir hesapta kay\u0131tl\u0131. Ba\u015fka bir adres dene.": "Hierdie e-posadres is by 'n ander rekening geregistreer. Probeer 'n ander een.", // EN: This email address is registered to another account. Try a different one.
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denendi. Birka\u00e7 dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Te veel pogings. Probeer weer oor 'n paar minute.", // EN: Too many attempts. Try again in a few minutes.
    "\u00c7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131": "Aflyn", // EN: Offline
    "Hedef okunmad\u0131": "Teiken nie gelees nie", // EN: Target not read
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm verisi yok": "Geen meetdata", // EN: No measurement data
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar hen\u00fcz s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem veya hava kalitesi verisi vermedi. Sens\u00f6r\u00fcn a\u00e7\u0131k ve a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Jou toestelle het nog nie temperatuur, humiditeit of lugkwaliteit gerapporteer nie. Maak seker die sensor is aan en op die netwerk.", // EN: Your devices have not reported temperature, humidity or air quality yet. Make sure the sensor is on and on the network.
    "Son okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler": "Laatste lesings", // EN: Latest readings
    "Skor \u00fcretmiyoruz; yaln\u0131zca cihazlardan okunan ger\u00e7ek de\u011ferler g\u00f6sterilir.": "Ons produseer nie 'n telling nie; slegs werklike waardes wat van jou toestelle gelees is, word aangedui.", // EN: We do not produce a score; only real values read from your devices are shown.
    "Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bitirdi\u011finde \u015fu cihazlara uygulan\u0131r.": "Wanneer jy klaarmaak, word dit op die volgende toestelle toegepas.", // EN: When you finish, this is applied to the following devices.
    "Uyku haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun cihaz yok": "Geen geskikte toestel vir slaapvoorbereiding nie", // EN: No suitable device for sleep preparation
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, kilit veya iklim cihaz\u0131 ekledi\u011finde haz\u0131rl\u0131k burada listelenir.": "Sodra jy 'n lig, gordyn, slot of klimaattoestel byvoeg, word die voorbereiding hier gelys.", // EN: Once you add a light, curtain, lock or climate device, the preparation is listed here.
    "\u0130klim cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu ve okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler.": "Laaste bekende toestand en lesings van jou klimaattoestelle.", // EN: Last known state and readings of your climate devices.
    "Kamera gizlili\u011fi": "Kamera privaatheid", // EN: Camera privacy
    "Her kameran\u0131n gizlilik modunu ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Bestuur elke kamera se privaatheidsmodus afsonderlik.", // EN: Manage each camera's privacy mode separately.
    "Kamera cihaz\u0131 yok": "Geen kameratoestel nie", // EN: No camera device
    "Kamera ekledi\u011finde gizlilik modu her kamera i\u00e7in burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Sodra jy 'n kamera byvoeg, verskyn sy privaatheidsmodus hier.", // EN: Once you add a camera, its privacy mode appears here.
    "Bu senaryoyu uygulayacak uygun cihaz yok": "Geen geskikte toestel om hierdie scenario uit te voer nie", // EN: No suitable device to run this scenario
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, klima veya kilit gibi uyumlu bir cihaz ekledi\u011finde burada listelenir.": "Sodra jy 'n versoenbare toestel soos 'n lig, gordyn, lugversorger of slot byvoeg, word dit hier gelys.", // EN: Once you add a compatible device such as a light, curtain, air conditioner or lock, it is listed here.
