    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Hierdie maand gestoor", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Geen ondersteunde toestel is op hierdie netwerk gevind nie.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Geen ondersteunde toestel is op hierdie netwerk gevind nie. Maak seker die toestel is aangeskakel en aan dieselfde Wi-Fi verbind; anders kan jy die katalogus hieronder of 'n QR-/opstellingskode gebruik.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
