    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Hierdie skerm groepeer die beligtingsapparaat wat jy bygevoeg het volgens kamer; wanneer jy 'n toneel stoor, word helderheid en toon saam ingestel.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Apparate wat jy by hierdie huis voeg, word hier gelys.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Apparate wat jy by hierdie huis voeg, word hier gelys en gekoppel aan jou gunstelingkaarte.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Is jy seker jy wil hierdie huis en al sy instellings permanent uitvee?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
