    "Cihazlar\u0131na dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edin, stratejilerle otomatik tasarruf et.": "Kry insigte oor jou toestelle en stoor outomaties met strategie\u00eb.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and save automatically with strategies.
