    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131za dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edinin ve enerji ipu\u00e7lar\u0131 al\u0131n.": "Kry insigte oor jou toestelle en energiewenke.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and energy tips.
    "Cihaz\u0131 Do\u011frula": "Verifieer Toestel", // EN: Verify Device
    "Cihaz\u0131 Se\u00e7": "Kies Toestel", // EN: Select Device
    "Cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r": "Verwyder toestel", // EN: Remove device
    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Hoekom wys my toestel as aflyn?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Tik die toestel se IP-adres in en NEXUS bepaal watter protokol dit gebruik.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Gaan die toestel se Wi-Fi-verbinding en jou router na. As die probleem voortduur, verwyder die toestel en voeg dit weer by. Stappe: Toestelle > kies die toestel > Verwyder.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Gaan die toestel se Wi-Fi-verbinding en jou router na. As die probleem voortduur, verwyder die toestel uit die NEXUS-app en voeg dit weer by.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "As jou toestel nie verskyn nie, gebruik QR-skandering of 'n instellingskode. Jy kan die hulpbladsy oopmaak vir ondersteuning en leiding.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Die liggingdiens (GPS) van jou toestel is afgeskakel. Skakel dit aan en probeer weer.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Jou toestel ondersteun nie liggingdienste nie.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
    "Cihaz\u0131n listede yok mu? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Toestel nie op die lys nie? Stuur terugvoer", // EN: Device not on the list? Send feedback
