    "Evet. NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "Ja. NEXUS is plaaslik-eerstens; jou toesteldata bly op hierdie toestel en word nie met derde partye gedeel nie.", // EN: Yes. NEXUS is local-first; your device data stays on this device and isn't shared with third parties.
