    "Matter cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 eklemek i\u00e7in bir Matter denetleyicisi gerekir; NEXUS bu deste\u011fi hen\u00fcz sunmuyor. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011flan\u0131yorsa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle ekleyebilirsin.": "Om Matter-toestelle by te voeg benodig 'n Matter-beheerder, wat NEXUS nog nie bied nie. As die toestel via Wi-Fi koppel, kan jy dit van jou plaaslike netwerk byvoeg deur sy IP-adres.", // EN: Adding Matter devices needs a Matter controller, which NEXUS doesn't offer yet. If the device connects over Wi-Fi, you can add it from your local network by its IP address.
