    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Die koppelingskode is nie geldig nie. Voer die 11-syfer kode of die QR-inhoud wat begin met MT: in.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Voer hierdie kode in die NEXUS-lessenaarsprogram in. As die toestel op Wi-Fi is, kan jy dit ook by jou plaaslike netwerk deur sy IP-adres voeg.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Die toestel word op dieselfde netwerk gesoek en gekoppel. Dit kan tot 'n minuut neem; die toestel moet aangeskakel wees en in koppelingsmodus wees.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Die toestel is nie gevind nie of kon nie gekoppel word nie. Maak seker dit is op dieselfde netwerk, aangeskakel en in koppelmodus.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Die toestel is nie gevind nie. Maak seker dit is op dieselfde netwerk, aangeskakel en in koppelmodus. Jou rekenaar se firewall mag antwoord van toestelle op die plaaslike netwerk blokkeer.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Die toestel kon nie gekoppeld word nie. Kontroleer die koppelkode en dat die toestel in koppelmodus is.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
