    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Sit jou toestelle in 'n veilige, energiebesparende toestand terwyl jy vir lang weg is.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
