    "Sahipli\u011fi Devret": "Dra Eienaarskap Oor", // EN: Transfer Ownership
    "Uygulama kapal\u0131yken aile mesaj\u0131 ve ev sahibinin payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131 uyar\u0131lar gelir. Ana anahtar, kategori ve sessiz saat ayarlar\u0131n sunucuya kopyalan\u0131r; uygulamay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda g\u00fcncellenir.": "Familieboodskappe en die waarskuwings wat die huiseienaar deel arriveer terwyl die app gesluit is. Jou hoofskakelaar-, kategorie- en stil-ure-instellings word na die bediener gekopieer; hulle werk op wanneer jy die app oopmaak.", // EN: Family messages and the alerts the home owner shares arrive while the app is closed. Your master switch, category and quiet-hours settings are copied to the server; they update when you open the app.
