    "MQTT broker \u00fczerinden Zigbee lamba ve prizler (masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda); \u015fimdilik a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k": "Zigbee-ligte en proppe deur 'n MQTT-makelaar (in die lessenaar-app); aan/af en helderheid vir nou", // EN: Zigbee lights and plugs through an MQTT broker (in the desktop app); on/off and brightness for now
