    "Broker'\u0131n (\u00f6r. Mosquitto) yerel IP adresini yaz. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 ve parola yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r. \u015eimdilik lamba ve prizlerde a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k desteklenir.": "Voer die plaaslike IP-adres van die bestuurder in (bv. Mosquitto). Die gebruikersnaam en wagwoord word slegs op hierdie toestel gestoor. Aan/uit en helderheid vir ligte en proppe word tans ondersteun.", // EN: Enter the local IP address of the broker (e.g. Mosquitto). The username and password are stored only on this device. On/off and brightness for lights and plugs are supported for now.
    "Broker IP adresi (\u00f6r. 192.168.1.10)": "Bestuurder IP-adres (bv. 192.168.1.10)", // EN: Broker IP address (e.g. 192.168.1.10)
