    "G\u00fcvenlik modu Gece olunca": "Wanneer sekuriteitsmodus op Nag is", // EN: When security mode is Night
    "G\u00fcvenlik modu (Evde/D\u0131\u015far\u0131da/Gece) de\u011fi\u015fti\u011finde": "Wanneer die sekuriteitsmodus (Tuis/Weg/Nag) verander", // EN: When the security mode (At home/Away/Night) changes
    "Yaln\u0131zca NEXUS modunu de\u011fi\u015ftirir; cihazlara dokunmaz.": "Verander net die NEXUS-modus; dit raak nie toestelle nie.", // EN: Only changes the NEXUS mode; it does not touch devices.
    "Mod de\u011fi\u015fince \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r (uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken). Bu mod NEXUS i\u00e7inde bir anahtard\u0131r; ger\u00e7ek bir alarm paneline ba\u011flanmaz ve cihazlar\u0131 kendili\u011finden kilitlemez.": "Loop wanneer die modus verander (terwyl die app oop is). Die modus is \u2019n skakel binne NEXUS; dit is nie aan \u2019n regte alarmsentrum gekoppel nie en sluit nie toestelle self nie.", // EN: Runs when the mode changes (while the app is open). The mode is a switch inside NEXUS; it is not connected to a real alarm panel and does not lock devices by itself.
    "\u015eimdiki mod:": "Huidige modus:", // EN: Current mode:
    "se\u00e7ilmemi\u015f": "nie gestel nie", // EN: not set
    "Konum tetikleyicisi hen\u00fcz desteklenmiyor, bu y\u00fczden kaydedilemez. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu, G\u00fcvenlik Modu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "Die ligging-trigger word nog nie ondersteun nie, so dit kan nie gestoor word nie. Wenktipes: Timer, Weer, Toesteltoestand, Sekuriteitsmodus en Wanneer Alarm afgaan (sensor).", // EN: The location trigger is not supported yet, so it cannot be saved. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State, Security Mode and When Alarm Triggers (sensor).
    "Uzak Eri\u015fim Adresi": "Afstands-toegangsadres", // EN: Remote Access Address
    "Evin d\u0131\u015f\u0131ndayken (VPN ya da port y\u00f6nlendirme) bir cihaza veya hub'a ba\u015fka bir adresten ula\u015f\u0131yorsan, yerel adres yan\u0131t vermedi\u011finde bu adres denenir. Yaln\u0131z bu cihazda saklan\u0131r.": "As jy \u2019n toestel of hub vanaf \u2019n ander adres bereik terwyl jy van die huis af is (VPN of poort-vooruitskakeling), word daardie adres probeer wanneer die plaaslike adres nie antwoord nie. Dit word slegs op hierdie toestel gestoor.", // EN: If you reach a device or hub from another address while away from home (VPN or port forwarding), that address is tried when the local address does not answer. It is stored only on this device.
    "\u00d6nce bir cihaz ekle; sonra ona uzak adres verebilirsin.": "Voeg eers \u2019n toestel by; dan kan jy \u2019n afstandsadres gee.", // EN: Add a device first; then you can give it a remote address.
    "Eve gelince": "Wanneer jy by die huis kom", // EN: When arriving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131k\u0131nca": "Wanneer jy die huis verlaat", // EN: When leaving home
    "Konum tetikleyicisi yaln\u0131zca mobil uygulamada \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; bu cihazda kurulamaz.": "Die ligging-trigger werk net in die mobiele app; dit kan nie op hierdie toestel opgestel word nie.", // EN: The location trigger only works in the mobile app; it cannot be set up on this device.
    "Konum tetikleyicisi yaln\u0131zca mobil uygulamada \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Die ligging-trigger werk slegs in die mobiele app.", // EN: The location trigger only works in the mobile app.
    "Ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi. \u00d6nce": "Geen tuis-ligging geselekteer nie. Eerstens", // EN: No home location selected. First
    "Ev konumuna g\u00f6re \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Yaln\u0131zca uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken denetlenir (arka planda konum izlenmez); yakla\u015f\u0131k dakikada bir okunur.": "Werk relatief tot jou tuis-ligging. Dit word slegs geverifieer terwyl die app oop is (ligging word nie op die agtergrond opgespoor nie); word ongeveer elke minuut gelees.", // EN: Works relative to your home location. It is only checked while the app is open (location is not tracked in the background); read about once a minute.
    "Konum izni verildi.": "Liggingtoestemming toegestaan.", // EN: Location permission granted.
    "Konum servisi bu cihazda kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Liggingdiens is nie beskikbaar op hierdie toestel nie.", // EN: Location service is not available on this device.
    "Konum izni verilmedi, tetikleyici \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaz.": "Liggingtoestemming nie toegestaan nie; die trigger sal nie werk nie.", // EN: Location permission not granted; the trigger will not run.
    "Konum izni ver": "Laat ligging toe", // EN: Allow location
