    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz ger\u00e7ek bir cihazla denenmedi.": "Hierdie tipe verbinding is nog nie met 'n regte toestel getoets nie.", // EN: This connection type has not been tested with a real device yet.
