    "Yedekle ve Geri Y\u00fckle": "Rugsteun & Herstel", // EN: Backup & Restore
    "Cihaz listesi, otomasyonlar, senaryolar ve ayarlar bir dosyaya kaydedilir. Cihaz parolalar\u0131, yerel anahtarlar, Telegram anahtar\u0131 ve oturum bilgisi yede\u011fe girmez.": "Jou toestellys, outomatiserings, tonele en instellings word na 'n l\u00eaer gestoor. Toestelwagwoorde, plaaslike sleutels, die Telegram-token en jou sessie is nie by die rugsteun ingesluit nie.", // EN: Your device list, automations, scenes and settings are saved to a file. Device passwords, local keys, the Telegram token and your session are not included in the backup.
    "Yede\u011fi d\u0131\u015fa aktar": "Voer rugsteun uit", // EN: Export backup
    "Hata Raporu": "Foutrapport", // EN: Error Report
    "Uygulamada olu\u015fan hatalar otomatik ve anonim olarak (ki\u015fisel veri olmadan) bize iletilir. \u0130stersen a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan kapatabilirsin.": "Foute wat in die app gebeur, word outomaties en anoniem aan ons gestuur (geen persoonlike data nie). Jy kan dit hieronder afskakel.", // EN: Errors that happen in the app are sent to us automatically and anonymously (no personal data). You can turn it off below.
    "Anonim Hata Raporu G\u00f6nder": "Stuur Anonieme Foutverslae", // EN: Send Anonymous Error Reports
    "Anonim hata raporu g\u00f6nder": "Stuur anonieme foutverslae", // EN: Send anonymous error reports
    "Yedekten geri y\u00fckle": "Herstel vanaf rugsteun", // EN: Restore from backup
    "E\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131na g\u00f6re haz\u0131r; tek dokunu\u015fla eklenir.": "Gereed vir jou gepaarde toestelle; bygevoeg met 'n enkele tik.", // EN: Ready for your paired devices; added with a single tap.
    "Senin i\u00e7in haz\u0131r": "Gereed vir jou", // EN: Ready for you
    "Dokununca e\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131nda hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Werk op jou gepaarde toestelle sodra jy dit tik.", // EN: Runs on your paired devices as soon as you tap it.
