    "Bu e-posta ile zaten bir hesap var. L\u00fctfen giri\u015f yap\u0131n.": "'n Rekening met hierdie e-pos bestaan reeds. Teken asseblief aan.", // EN: An account with this email already exists. Please sign in.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "Hierdie skakel het verval of is ongeldig. Probeer asseblief weer.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "Wolkrekening is gedeaktiveer in hierdie weergawe; plaaslike rekening wagwoorde kan nie gerestel word nie.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "As hierdie adres aan 'n rekening gekoppel is, is 'n herstel-skakel gestuur. Kontroleer jou inkassie (en rommelpos).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denedin. Bir dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Te veel pogings. Probeer asseblief weer oor 'n minuut.", // EN: Too many attempts. Please try again in a minute.
