    "Bu cihazdaki g\u00fcvenlik/acil olaylar\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve k\u0131sa metni evdeki di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin uygulamas\u0131nda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Cihaz bilgileri ve anahtarlar payla\u015f\u0131lmaz; her \u00fcye kendi bildirim ayarlar\u0131na tabidir.": "Die titel en kort teks van sekuriteit-/noodgevalle op hierdie toestel verskyn in ander lede se toepassings in hierdie huis. Toestelbesonderhede en sleutels word nooit gedeel nie; elke lid volg hul eie kennisgewinginstellings.", // EN: The title and short text of security/emergency events on this device appear in other members' apps in this home. Device details and keys are never shared; every member follows their own notification settings.
    "Evden Ayr\u0131l": "Verlaat huis", // EN: Leave Home
    "Ayr\u0131l": "Verlaat", // EN: Leave
    "Davet e-postas\u0131ndaki kodu gir. Kod tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131kt\u0131r ve yaln\u0131zca davet edilen e-posta adresiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Voer die kode uit die uitnodigings-e-pos in. Die kode is eenmalig en werk slegs met die genooi-e-posadres.", // EN: Enter the code from the invitation email. The code is single-use and only works with the invited email address.
    "Oturum gerekli": "Teken aan vereis", // EN: Sign-in required
    "\u00dcye davet etmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce oturum a\u00e7; evin hesab\u0131na otomatik ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Meld eers aan om lede uit te nooi; jy sal outomaties aan jou huis se rekening gekoppel word.", // EN: Sign in first to invite members; you'll be connected to your home's account automatically.
    "E-posta sunucudan g\u00f6nderilemedi": "Die e-pos kon nie van die bediener gestuur word nie", // EN: The email couldn't be sent from the server
    "Davet olu\u015fturuldu ama otomatik e-posta g\u00f6nderilemedi. Kendi posta uygulamanla davet metnini haz\u0131rlayal\u0131m m\u0131?": "Die uitnodiging is geskep, maar die outomatiese e-pos kon nie gestuur word nie. Sal ons die uitnodigingsteks met jou eie posprogram voorberei?", // EN: The invite was created but the automatic email couldn't be sent. Shall we prepare the invitation text with your own mail app?
    "Posta Uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Maak Posprogram oop", // EN: Open Mail App
    "I\u015f\u0131k d\u00fczeyi": "Ligvlak", // EN: Light level
    "Bas\u0131n\u00e7": "Druk", // EN: Pressure
    "Hareket alg\u0131land\u0131": "Beweging opgespoor", // EN: Motion detected
    "Hareket yok": "Geen beweging", // EN: No motion
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Kon nie aan die toestel koppel nie. Maak seker dit is op dieselfde netwerk.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network.
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Kon nie aan die toestel koppel nie. Maak seker dit is op dieselfde netwerk en dat die IP-adres en plaaslike sleutel korrek is.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "Skakel die ligte aan in 'n warm toon, maak die gordyne oop en stel die lugversorger op 22\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "Skakel die ligte aan en maak die gordyne oop, laat die lugversorger op 22\u00b0 loop en stuur die stofsuier terug om te laai.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Skakel die ligte, TV en lugversorger af, maak die gordyne toe en sluit die deur.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Skakel die ligte en TV af, sluit die gordyne en sluit die deur toe.", // EN: Turns off the lights and TV, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %15 s\u0131cak tona getirir, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, TV'yi a\u00e7ar.": "Stel die ligte op 'n warm toon by 15%, sluit die gordyne en skakel die TV aan.", // EN: Sets the lights to a warm tone at 15%, closes the curtains and turns on the TV.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler, perdeleri kapat\u0131r.": "Sluit die deur toe en sluit die gordyne.", // EN: Locks the door and closes the curtains.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %70 parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Skakel die ligte aan by 70% helderheid.", // EN: Turns the lights on at 70% brightness.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "Begin die robotstofsuiwer.", // EN: Starts the robot vacuum.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 10:00": "Weeksdae 10:00", // EN: Weekdays 10:00
    "Klimay\u0131 ve termostat\u0131 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir, hava temizleyiciyi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Stel die lugre\u00ebling en termostaat op die gemaklike instelling en laat die lugreiniger loop.", // EN: Sets the AC and thermostat to the comfort setting and runs the air purifier.
    "Bildirim g\u00f6nderir": "Stuur 'n kennisgewing", // EN: Sends a notification
    "Bu senaryo mevcut cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 etkilemiyor. Senaryonun \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun bir cihaz (\u00f6r. \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, s\u00fcp\u00fcrge) eklemelisin.": "Hierdie scenario be\u00efnvloed nie enige van jou huidige toestelle nie. Om dit te laat werk, voeg 'n geskikte toestel by (bv. 'n lig, gordyn of stofsuiwer).", // EN: This scenario doesn't affect any of your current devices. To make it work, add a suitable device (e.g. a light, curtain or vacuum).
    "Yeni bir ev olu\u015ftur ya da sana g\u00f6nderilen davet koduyla bir eve kat\u0131l.": "Skep 'n nuwe huis, of sluit aan by een met die uitnodigingskode wat aan jou gestuur is.", // EN: Create a new home, or join one with the invite code sent to you.
    "Oturum a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil. Evler yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda tutulur. \u00dcye davet etmek, bir eve kat\u0131lmak ve aile sohbeti i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7.": "Jy is nie ingeteken nie. Huise word slegs op hierdie toestel gehou. Meld aan om lede uit te nooi, by 'n huis aan te sluit en die gesinsgeselskap te gebruik.", // EN: You're not signed in. Homes are kept on this device only. Sign in to invite members, join a home and use the family chat.
    "Shelly 1 / 1PM R\u00f6le": "Shelly 1 / 1PM Skakelaar", // EN: Shelly 1 / 1PM Relay
    "Shelly RGBW2 \u015eerit": "Shelly RGBW2 Strik", // EN: Shelly RGBW2 Strip
