    "Yerel \u015fifreli HTTP (KLAP) \u2014 TP-Link hesab\u0131 e-postas\u0131 + \u015fifresiyle, masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; priz, anahtar ve ampuller (kamera ve enerji \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm\u00fc hen\u00fcz yok)": "Plaaslike gekodeerde HTTP (KLAP) \u2014 met jou TP-Link-rekening e-pos + wagwoord, in die lessenaar-toep; proppe, skakelaars en gloeilampe (kamera en energiemeting nog nie beskikbaar nie)", // EN: Local encrypted HTTP (KLAP) — with your TP-Link account email + password, in the desktop app; plugs, switches and bulbs (camera and energy metering not available yet)
