    "Which device should I turn off? Use a device name, a room or a type like \"lights\" or \"plugs\". Your paired devices: {0}.": "Watter toestel moet ek afskakel? Gebruik 'n toestelnaam, 'n kamer of 'n tipe soos \"ligte\" of \"proppe\". Jou gekoppelde toestelle: {0}.", // EN: Which device should I turn off? Use a device name, a room or a type like "lights" or "plugs". Your paired devices: {0}.
