    "The {0} scene does not change any of your paired devices, so I did not save it. Try again after adding a suitable device.": "Die {0} toneel verander geen van jou gekoppelde toestelle nie, so ek het dit nie gestoor nie. Probeer weer nadat jy 'n geskikte toestel bygevoeg het.", // EN: The {0} scene does not change any of your paired devices, so I did not save it. Try again after adding a suitable device.
    "I set up the \"{0}\" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} devices. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).": "Ek het die \"{0}\" outomatisering opgestel: dit loop {1} en pas {2} toestelle aan. Outomatiserings loop terwyl die app oop is (ook vanaf die tray op lessenaar).", // EN: I set up the "{0}" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} devices. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).
    "I set up the \"{0}\" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} device. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).": "Ek het die \"{0}\" outomatisering opgestel: dit hardloop {1} en stel {2} toestel aan. Outomatiserings werk terwyl die app oop is (ook van die tray op die lessenaar af).", // EN: I set up the "{0}" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} device. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).
    "I added \"{0}\" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} devices.": "Ek het \"{0}\" by Tik om te Hardloop gevoeg; een tik stel {1} toestelle aan.", // EN: I added "{0}" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} devices.
    "I added \"{0}\" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} device.": "Ek het \"{0}\" by Tik om te Hardloop gevoeg; een tik stel {1} toestel aan.", // EN: I added "{0}" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} device.
    "That does not look like a device command. Try: \"turn off the living room light\" or \"set the AC to 22\".": "Dit lyk nie soos 'n toestel-opdrag nie. Probeer: \"skakel die sitkamerlig af\" of \"stel die airconditioning op 22\".", // EN: That does not look like a device command. Try: "turn off the living room light" or "set the AC to 22".
    "No active subscription": "Geen aktiewe intekening nie", // EN: No active subscription
    "There is no subscription to manage on this account. If you want to join NEXUS+, you can do it from the Plus page.": "Daar is geen intekening om te bestuur op hierdie rekening nie. As jy by NEXUS+ wil aansluit, kan jy dit vanaf die Plus-bladsy doen.", // EN: There is no subscription to manage on this account. If you want to join NEXUS+, you can do it from the Plus page.
