    "Your subscription ends at the close of the current period; you can keep using NEXUS+ until then.": "Jou intekening eindig aan die einde van die huidige periode; jy kan steeds NEXUS+ gebruik tot dan.", // EN: Your subscription ends at the close of the current period; you can keep using NEXUS+ until then.
    "Next renewal: {0}. If you cancel, you keep access until the end of this period; no further payment is taken.": "Volgende hernuwing: {0}. As jy kanselleer, hou jy toegang tot die einde van hierdie periode; geen verdere betaling word afgetrek.", // EN: Next renewal: {0}. If you cancel, you keep access until the end of this period; no further payment is taken.
